1928 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Binary Classification Dataset\nTwo diagonals\nClass determined by whether orientations match\n\050CNNs inherently suited for the dataset\nSpatial locality\072\nFilters detect diagonals\nDeeper layers compose orientations\nTranslation invariance\072 \nShared filter weights detect the same pattern anywhere on the grid\n\nWhy competing models struggle\nNo spatial awareness\072 must detect patterns through other signals\nNo translation invariance\072 must generalise across 3456 distinct combinations\n\nArbitrary placement and diagonal orientations inherently suit CNN inductive biases)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 1929 0 R
     /Pg 1906 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
